<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Ley de Boyle-Mariotte</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;800&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#eef2f4;--panel:#fff;--ink:#14263b;--mute:#586b7d;--line:#cfd9e0;--gas:#0e8f8a;--sig:#e8a800;--ok:#1b7f45;--bad:#b3261e;--cyl:#dde6ec;--pist:#14263b;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0e1822;--panel:#16232f;--ink:#e6eef4;--mute:#92a5b5;--line:#2a3b4a;--gas:#3fd0c9;--sig:#f2b705;--ok:#58c885;--bad:#ff8a80;--cyl:#1d2e3b;--pist:#e6eef4}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0e1822;--panel:#16232f;--ink:#e6eef4;--mute:#92a5b5;--line:#2a3b4a;--gas:#3fd0c9;--sig:#f2b705;--ok:#58c885;--bad:#ff8a80;--cyl:#1d2e3b;--pist:#e6eef4}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.55 'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 48px}
h1,h2{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque','Arial Narrow',system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.1;margin:0}
h1{font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,52px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;margin:36px 0 10px}
.lead{color:var(--mute);margin:10px 0 18px;max-width:60ch}
.eq{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,40px);letter-spacing:.01em}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:190px;border-radius:6px}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.stat{flex:1 1 90px;border-left:3px solid var(--sig);padding-left:10px}
.stat b{display:block;font:800 26px/1.1 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif}
.stat span{color:var(--mute);font-size:13px}
input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--gas);height:36px;margin:8px 0 0}
label{font-weight:500}
button{font:500 15px 'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer}
button.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--sig);outline-offset:2px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
@media(min-width:640px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.scroll{overflow-x:auto}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
th,td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right}
th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}
th{font-weight:500;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
svg text{fill:var(--mute);font:12px 'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif}
p{margin:8px 0}
input[type=number]{font:inherit;width:90px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
.by{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Ley de Boyle-Mariotte</h1>
<p class="by">Hecho por s.escursell</p>
<p class="lead">Si comprimes un gas sin cambiar su temperatura, su presión sube. Compruébalo moviendo el émbolo.</p>
<div class="eq">P · V = constante</div>

<h2>Simulación</h2>
<div class="card">
  <canvas id="cv" aria-label="Cilindro con partículas de gas y émbolo"></canvas>
  <label for="vol">Volumen: <span id="vlab">10.0</span> L</label>
  <input id="vol" type="range" min="1" max="10" step="0.1" value="10">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="stat"><b id="p">1.0</b><span>presión (atm)</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="v">10.0</b><span>volumen (L)</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="pv">10.0</b><span>P · V (atm·L)</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b id="hits">0</b><span>choques/s en el émbolo</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="row"><button id="rec">Anotar medida</button><button class="alt" id="clr">Borrar medidas</button></div>
</div>

<h2>Qué ocurre</h2>
<p>La cantidad de gas (30 partículas) y la temperatura (la velocidad de las partículas) no cambian. Al reducir el volumen, las partículas recorren menos distancia entre choques, golpean el émbolo más veces por segundo y la presión sube.</p>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="card">
    <strong>Gráfica P–V</strong>
    <svg id="ch" viewBox="0 0 320 230" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Gráfica presión frente a volumen: una hipérbola"></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="card scroll">
    <strong>Tus medidas</strong>
    <table><thead><tr><th>V (L)</th><th>P (atm)</th><th>P·V</th></tr></thead><tbody id="tb"><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;color:var(--mute)">Mueve el émbolo y pulsa «Anotar medida».</td></tr></tbody></table>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Para calcular</h2>
<p>Con la temperatura constante, entre dos estados: <b>P₁ · V₁ = P₂ · V₂</b></p>
<p>Despeja: P₂ = P₁ · V₁ / V₂. Aplicación típica: aire comprimido en neumática, donde el cilindro y el compresor siguen esta relación.</p>


<h2>Condiciones</h2>
<p>Solo vale con temperatura y cantidad de gas constantes, y con gases a presiones moderadas. Si calientas el gas o añades más, ya no se cumple y hace falta la ecuación de los gases ideales: P·V = n·R·T.</p>
</main>

<script>
const K=10, N=30, VMAX=10;
const cv=document.getElementById('cv'), ctx=cv.getContext('2d');
const vol=document.getElementById('vol');
let W=0,H=0,dpr=1;
function resize(){dpr=window.devicePixelRatio||1;W=cv.clientWidth;H=cv.clientHeight;cv.width=W*dpr;cv.height=H*dpr;ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0)}
addEventListener('resize',resize);resize();
const L=10, R=()=>W-30; // cylinder inner x range
const px=()=>L+(parseFloat(vol.value)/VMAX)*(R()-L);
const parts=Array.from({length:N},()=>{const a=Math.random()*6.283;return{x:Math.random()*100+15,y:Math.random()*150+20,vx:Math.cos(a)*110,vy:Math.sin(a)*110}});
let hitCount=0, hitShown=0, tAcc=0, last=performance.now();
const css=n=>getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(n).trim();
function step(now){
  const dt=Math.min((now-last)/1000,.05);last=now;
  const pr=px(), top=10, bot=H-10;
  for(const p of parts){
    p.x+=p.vx*dt;p.y+=p.vy*dt;
    if(p.x<L+4){p.x=L+4;p.vx=Math.abs(p.vx)}
    if(p.x>pr-4){p.x=pr-4;p.vx=-Math.abs(p.vx);hitCount++}
    if(p.y<top+4){p.y=top+4;p.vy=Math.abs(p.vy)}
    if(p.y>bot-4){p.y=bot-4;p.vy=-Math.abs(p.vy)}
  }
  tAcc+=dt;if(tAcc>=1){hitShown=hitCount;hitCount=0;tAcc=0;document.getElementById('hits').textContent=hitShown}
  ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);
  ctx.fillStyle=css('--cyl');ctx.fillRect(L,10,pr-L,H-20);
  ctx.strokeStyle=css('--mute');ctx.lineWidth=3;ctx.strokeRect(L,10,R()-L+14,H-20);
  ctx.fillStyle=css('--gas');
  for(const p of parts){ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,4,0,6.283);ctx.fill()}
  ctx.fillStyle=css('--pist');ctx.fillRect(pr,4,8,H-8);ctx.fillRect(pr+8,H/2-4,W-pr-8,8);
  requestAnimationFrame(step)
}
requestAnimationFrame(step);

const f1=x=>x.toFixed(1);
const ch=document.getElementById('ch');
const cx=v=>40+v/10*260, cy=p=>195-p/10*180;
let rec=[];
function chart(){
  let s='';
  for(let i=0;i<=10;i+=2){s+=`<line x1="${cx(i)}" x2="${cx(i)}" y1="15" y2="195" stroke="${css('--line')}"/><line x1="40" x2="300" y1="${cy(i)}" y2="${cy(i)}" stroke="${css('--line')}"/><text x="${cx(i)}" y="210" text-anchor="middle">${i}</text><text x="34" y="${cy(i)+4}" text-anchor="end">${i}</text>`}
  s+=`<text x="170" y="225" text-anchor="middle">V (L)</text><text x="4" y="10">P (atm)</text>`;
  let d='';for(let v=1;v<=10.01;v+=.25)d+=(d?'L':'M')+cx(v)+' '+cy(K/v);
  s+=`<path d="${d}" fill="none" stroke="${css('--gas')}" stroke-width="2.5"/>`;
  for(const r of rec)s+=`<circle cx="${cx(r.v)}" cy="${cy(r.p)}" r="4" fill="${css('--ink')}"/>`;
  const v=parseFloat(vol.value);
  s+=`<circle cx="${cx(v)}" cy="${cy(K/v)}" r="7" fill="${css('--sig')}" stroke="${css('--ink')}" stroke-width="2"/>`;
  ch.innerHTML=s;
}
function update(){
  const v=parseFloat(vol.value), p=K/v;
  document.getElementById('vlab').textContent=f1(v);
  document.getElementById('v').textContent=f1(v);
  document.getElementById('p').textContent=p.toFixed(2);
  document.getElementById('pv').textContent=f1(v*p);
  chart();
}
vol.addEventListener('input',update);update();
matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').addEventListener('change',update);
function table(){
  const tb=document.getElementById('tb');
  tb.innerHTML=rec.length?rec.map(r=>`<tr><td>${f1(r.v)}</td><td>${r.p.toFixed(2)}</td><td>${f1(r.v*r.p)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;color:var(--mute)">Mueve el émbolo y pulsa «Anotar medida».</td></tr>';
}
document.getElementById('rec').onclick=()=>{const v=parseFloat(vol.value);rec.push({v,p:K/v});if(rec.length>8)rec.shift();table();chart()};
document.getElementById('clr').onclick=()=>{rec=[];table();chart()};

</script>
</body>
</html>
